## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.8 Flash
- **Short description:** Alibaba’s Qwen 3.8 Flash is described in local metadata as a sparse MoE model for cheap, high-volume coding and agent workloads with large hosted context.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba/Qwen hosted and open-weights ecosystem references in local metadata (Qoder app, Model Studio, Hugging Face). Local metadata lists `opencode/qwen-3.8-flash`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release and knowledge cutoff not independently verified from accessible official public sources in this pass.
- **IDs:** `qwen-3.8-flash` (as referenced in local metadata).
- **Context window:** 1M API context (262K native; 131K output) per local metadata.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** ~$0.15 / $0.47 per 1M in/out (API), free in Qoder app (ratio 0.0), $0 self-host (open weights) per local metadata; not independently verified from accessible official pricing pages in this pass.
- **Architecture:** Sparse MoE (6B active) per local metadata; not independently verified from accessible official sources in this pass.

